Description: Accept UTF-8 clipboard text from ExtendedClipboard viewers
 libvncserver negotiates the ExtendedClipboard extension only when the
 server sets setXCutTextUTF8, so x11vnc took clipboard text as Latin-1
 and offered it to X clients as STRING alone. It now registers that hook,
 keeps the text as UTF-8, and offers UTF8_STRING next to STRING in
 TARGETS (as XA_ATOM, per the ICCCM), converting between Latin-1 and
 UTF-8 for whichever target a requestor asks for. CUT_BUFFER0 stays
 Latin-1. Text from classic viewers is unchanged.
